  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 against ADR-0062 (2026-10-29). The out-of-doc token table this item relies on is adopted (section 3). Three premises have moved. (1) Posted discussion entries are op-only 'message: string' with by/actor already in the ops log, and drafts are one Y.Text per client, so 'discussion Y.Text runs' from three co-authors do not exist; only title and description are co-edited. (2) The doc is rebuilt from the ops log at startup with no pycrdt-store (section 5), and the projection overwrites the live doc (section 2), so erasing committed text has to go through ops. (3) Tokens are per-session server memory. Orphan-fragment measurement still applies to title and description. MECHANISM: ADR-0062 makes committed text ops-log-authoritative and rebuilds the doc from it, so a live-doc-only erasure is undone by re-projection; co-edited runs exist only in title/description. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-fujus,WI-pufun."  # 5cb1
